### Summary of changes

**`client/src/service/chat.js`** — two new logical sections added:

| Method | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `parseMessageBlocks(content, loading)` | Full markdown-to-blocks parser (extracted from `Document.vue`'s `parseContent`). Handles nested fences, assigns renderer types, tracks streaming `finished` state. |
| `_generateHash(str)` | djb2 hash helper used by the parser. |
| `_getBlockRenderer(blockType)` | Maps block type string → renderer name. |
| `loadFileDiffInfo({ api, file, code })` | Calls `api.files.diff`, normalises the result, returns `{ diff, stats, last_modification, size }`. Error-safe. |
| `readFileContent({ api, file })` | Calls `api.files.read`, returns content string. Error-safe. |

**`client/src/components/document/Document.vue`** — `parseContent` local function removed; `blocks` computed now delegates to `this.$service.chat.parseMessageBlocks(...)`.

**`client/src/components/CodeViewer.vue`** — `loadDiffInfo` and `onShowDiff` now delegate to `this.chatSvc.loadFileDiffInfo(...)` and `this.chatSvc.readFileContent(...)` respectively. A `chatSvc` computed shortcut was added.
